{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44247","headline":"次韵西邻新居兼乞酒 · 鱼玄机","name":"次韵西邻新居兼乞酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一首诗来百度吟，新情字字又声金。\n西看已有登垣意，远望能无化石心。\n河汉期赊空极目，潇湘梦断罢调琴。\n况逢寒节添乡思，叔夜佳醪莫独斟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}